cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite this software release and the accompanying paper."
title: "Detection of Upper-Level Troughs and Ridges Using Deep Learning"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: BSD-3-Clause
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation for detecting upper-level trough and ridge axes
  from ERA5 500 hPa geopotential height and horizontal wind fields. The
  software provides reproducible PyTorch Lightning training and inference
  pipelines for the expert-labelled benchmark described in the accompanying
  paper.
